WEBVTT

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.860
Thank you for saving us, Visitor-sama!

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.860
Huh? What happened?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.660
Star Children are automatically protected

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.870
by holy Matryoshka dolls 
when they are in danger.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.870
Yes, please do not worry!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.640
I see...

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.520
But what about your wounds?

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.750
You've recovered?

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.750
Yes, we've fully recovered!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.510
That's good.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.110
You stand no chance against them right now!

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.010
We have to train at the 
foster home right away!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:36.640
Got it!

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.010
Itsuki, you must defeat 
the Impurities next time.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:44.770
I know. I don't want to let the
 Star Children suffer like that again.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.320
All right. Let's go, guys!

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.020
Yes, Visitor-sama!

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:53.670
Itsuki is starting to develop 
his sense of duty as a Visitor.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.880
All that's left is to improve 
his technique for the Love Ritual!

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:01.070
Well, he was a little boy with an
 unpopped cherry until a few days ago,

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.790
so I'll share my experience

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:06.490
and pass my technique from *** 
on the back to **** in detailー

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:09.040
Help me!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.800
They're too strong...

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.010
Already? No way!

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.280
This isn't going to work. 
We can't even scratch them.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.510
We need more training...

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.910
This is not right! Something is really wrong!

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:21.890
Narcisstes!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.720
Calm down, Mana.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:27.520
A typical Visitor would've 
defeated an Impurity Lord by now!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.530
He still can't beat a single minion!

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.630
I'm sorry. My lack of effort is to blame.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:35.570
Are you even listening?

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:38.670
Mana, have you forgotten?

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:43.330
The maidens of the 12 constellations 
have never changed all at once before.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.080
Wh-What are you trying to say?

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.790
What I'm trying to say is that 
we're in a state of emergency.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.590
Does that mean there's no way 
for me to defeat the Impurities?

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.440
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.240
The academics knew 
of this from ancient texts,

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.590
although they were 
disregarded as mere legends...

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.600
D-Don't tell me, you're saying...

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.870
Listen well, Itsuki.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.350
In order to get past this crisis,

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:09.210
you have no choice but to 
perform a Double Love Ritual.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.740
Um, what's a Double Love Ritual?

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.490
I bet you already know!

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.400
It's a ritual where you have 
two partners at once!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.180
Since you're handling two 
partners at the same time,

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:54.640
you'll need sufficient stamina, 
but it's practically a buffet!

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.860
Two arms and legs may not be enough!

00:03:56.860 --> 00:04:01.260
But you know, you can fully activate 
Little Itsuki in the middle!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.720
Good for you, pervert!

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.340
I don't understand.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.330
It's a three****, a three****!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.520
Be a man and stop pretending!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.480
Well, if I were explain it
 to an honors student,

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.450
it's a lovey dovey activity performed 
by a group of men and women!

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.850
You wanna try that, don't you?!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.360
I can probably handle it 
if it's a group activity.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:22.060
Oh, you perv! Then, do you know this?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.920
It'll be like you're in heaven!

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.460
It's group cooperative play completely 
different from sixty-nining.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.990
A whole new experience!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.660
Can I really do this?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.210
Don't worry!

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:34.140
The Visitor can leave everything
 to the maidens!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.670
You know, it's what they call... in Sola...

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.420
the popular fish for sushi!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.080
Are you talking about my favorite, tuー

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.610
Yes, tuna!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:45.260
You just need to focus on one spot,

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.050
and lie there like a dead fish!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.680
The two maidens will tussle 
and cook you right up!

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.000
According to ancient texts,

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.900
Star Children born of a Double Love Ritual 
are even more remarkable.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.690
They are supposedly stronger 
than the ones you've made so far.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:01.940
Supposedly?

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.700
For at least the past few hundred years,

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:09.630
a Visitor capable of bonding with multiple 
maidens was thought to be impossible.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:14.430
In other words, a Double Love Ritual 
is uncharted territory even for us.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.580
I see.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:20.380
In addition, we can't even 
imagine what kind of damage

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.460
will be inflicted on the Visitor.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.210
Is there any other way?

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:28.440
I'm sorry. We can't think of any other 
way to defeat Impurities at the moment.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:32.010
Be proud! You'll be a pioneer 
exploring bold new frontiers!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.000
In layman's terms, the pervert 
Visitor who has the ability

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.690
to promiscuously bond with the 
maidens of the 12 constellations

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:38.760
is none other than you!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.650
You get it now?!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.290
Please let me think about this.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.740
Just what is Mana thinking?

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.340
Granvania has what they 
call hot springs in Sola.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:55.230
It's a good opportunity for you two 
to relax and relieve your fatigue.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:59.390
Not to mention, doing it under the 
blue sky is liberating like nothing else!

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:04.580
Although, you might learn of a new pleasure 
and be exhausted when you get back!

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.440
He must be up to something again.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.790
Again?

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.510
Actually, there's this Double Love Ritualー

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.770
Please finish your sentence!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.270
Never mind.

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:22.230
Itsuki, you've always been like this.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.990
I'll go get it.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.000
What's this?

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.840
It's pretty beat-up.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.740
No! Don't look!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.240
Is that...

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.810
Don't get any funny ideas! 
I'm just keeping it because it's cute.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.380
It's not like I treasure it because 
it's your gift or anything!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.260
Wow! I've never been to a 
hot spring like this before!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.040
But there's only one spring...

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.840
Who cares? We can go in together.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.890
We used to take baths together 
all the time, right?

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.100
Yeah.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.490
As if!

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.590
That was before elementary schoolー

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.060
Quit your yapping!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.480
I'm getting in without you.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.860
Hey Mahiru, cut it out!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.670
What kind of lewd things are you imagining?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.200
I came prepared expecting 
something like this.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.780
It's so good! It feels like I'm about to melt!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.090
Come on, Itsuki!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.300
Aren't you a man? Don't be embarrassed!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.970
Just take them off!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.930
Don't look this way.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.980
What? Don't talk to me like I'm a pervert.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.380
This really is a nice hot spring.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:43.290
Ow, but it stings a bit.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.000
What is it?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.360
That...

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.040
Sorry, am I dirty?

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:54.270
No, why do you have so many wounds?

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.520
I guess they're from the training.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:59.210
But it feels like I leveled up a lot.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.370
Still not strong enough to 
beat Impurities, though.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.370
Then you'll have more...

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.220
Yes, of course.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:07.130
I have to try my best.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.020
What's wrong, Mahiru?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.720
Hello? You there?

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:17.890
Listen well. The battles are 
getting tough, but don't die!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.810
What's this, all of a sudden...

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.230
Shut up and listen!

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.310
I'm saying you mustn't die!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.310
Of course. I won't allow myself to die
until I take you back home.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.820
Is that right?

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.360
Don't worry.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.940
The Star Children and I are 
definitely getting stronger.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.820
I think we can beat some Impurities next time.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.140
It may not look like it, but Mahiru 
is a faint-hearted crybaby.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.790
So you must keep protecting her.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.280
Yeah, I'll definitely protect you.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:44.750
But Mahiru isn't a crybaby, right?

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.250
Sorry, it's not like me 
to be in doubt, right?

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.410
But we were suddenly sent to this world,

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:55.260
and they call us the 
chosen Visitor and maiden...

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:59.880
And not too long ago we 
were in a... Love Ritual...

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.580
Mahiru?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.280
What happened to me?

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.080
You overheated and passed out.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.070
Are you all right? How are you feeling?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:20.430
I see. Sorry for causing you trouble.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.630
Don't worry about it.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:24.760
Anyway, it's getting chilly. Let's head back.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.080
Okay, I got it.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.080
Huh? Where's my keychain?

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:33.640
Sorry, I was busy trying to 
save you, and forgot about it.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.970
I'm sure it's in the hot spring.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.390
If it's gone, I...

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.710
Hey, Mahiru?

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:41.970
It's so cold!

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:49.770
I heard this hot spring turns 
into cold water after sunset.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.310
Mahiru, please get changed and wait for me.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:52.400
I'll take care of the rest.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.800
You're the Visitor, and the fate 
of this world rests in your hands.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.740
I can't let you catch a cold.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.740
Don't worry. Wait here.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.490
Okay.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.120
Itsuki...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.350
Found it!

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.340
I found it, Mahiru!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.800
My little keychain!

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:17.800
Here. Don't lose it next time.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.180
I'm so glad... Thank you.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:26.800
Mahiru, let's stay together like this, 
even when we grow up to be adults.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.740
No way. You remembered it?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.230
Yeah, just now.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.800
It was my duty to save you 
when you need help, right?

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.160
I'm sorry for forgetting.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:40.570
But you remembered our 
promise this whole time.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:43.900
It was just a silly promise
 between two kids.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:46.170
I got all serious about it...

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:47.950
I'm so stupid, aren't I?

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.630
No, that's the Mahiru I...

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.730
Now, now, you two. Please continue 
after you get in this carriage!

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:06.200
Deepen your bond until you arrive the shrine!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.230
But don't forget to hold it! 
You have to hold it, all right?

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.930
Until you arrive, you mustn't release it!

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.600
You have to hold your bonds at their peak,

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.480
and take it all the way to the Love Ritual!

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.900
What? But...

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:22.890
But in exchange, I packed plenty 
of recommended adult toys!

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:29.290
Moving **** and vibrating 
**** are great for getaways!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.910
Ugh, what's its problem?

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.720
You don't have to tell me.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.750
Girls in Sola are all waiting for a 
prince on a white horse, right?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.580
If the prince wants some action, 
then it's all right, isn't it?

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.920
Oh, Mahiru! Don't tell me that just thinking

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:44.670
about getting in this
 magical carriage for adults

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:48.360
is getting your maiden's *** all *** wet?

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:53.360
Worry not. If it's still not lubricated enough,
 I also packed strawberry-flavored ****,

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.840
so feel free to use it!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.940
Sheesh! Say something, Itsuki!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.580
There's no way he has anything
 to complain about!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.940
Getting in this see-through carriage 
is the dream of every person in Sola.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:06.510
Being watched excites you? 
What a kinky freak!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:10.350
Anyway, this carriage makes the ultimate 
dream of men and women come true.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:10.950
Its name is...

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.960
The Granvania Dream Coach!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.330
You're wrong, Mana.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.340
Itsuki?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.060
Listen, the best part of this carriage

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.400
should be being able to see from inside, 
but not from the outside.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.500
But what is this?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.720
You can see everything!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.470
This completely ruins all the 
excitement and titillation!

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:30.390
I'm leaving.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.380
All I'm asking is that
 you take care of his wounds!

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.350
Got it, Mana? I'm counting on you.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:39.640
I put so much work into that plan!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.710
It was a masterpiece that 
took me ten years to complete!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.110
Sorry, but the concept was...

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.620
Shut up! You letch!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.490
You've become much stronger 
in such a short time.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:54.190
Oh, no! It's not even the flu season yet.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.250
What's wrong?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.380
Actually...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:13:00.750
Long story short, my fabulous Double 
Love Ritual Plan was completely ruined!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:04.010
You mean... the legendary Double Love Ritual?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.380
That's right.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.520
With all of the unknown factors,

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.220
performing the Double 
Love Ritual in his current condition

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.270
is not something I can 
recommend as a doctor.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.760
What?!

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:17.440
But it'll be fine if I can get the data 
for what will happen to Itsuki's body

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.080
before the real thing.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.980
I'll be able to treat him 
if something happens.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.020
Geez, the real thing?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.680
That's a pretty old way of saying it, Reone!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:28.670
What will happen to Itsuki's Big 
Magnum during the real thing?

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.580
Come on, we already know what'll happen!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.480
So, what do you want to know? 
The rate of expansion?

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.970
Or how long he'll last?

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:39.000
No way! You want to know his 
sustained frictional temperature?!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.630
For now, let's have a brief nap.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:47.380
In any case, I need Itsuki's physical data, 
so let's practice together.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.390
You mean...

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.120
Yes. I will be one of the two maidens.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.400
I'll let you pick the other.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.390
Huh? But...

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.710
It must be nice to be young.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.580
I have some apples, would you like one?

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.770
If you want it, I'll peel it for you.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:07.900
Or should I just rub it 
a bit and feed it to you?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:11.410
Um... then... please bake it.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.540
Huh? What did you just say?

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.120
Oh, you can't make it, right?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.000
Sorry for making an impossible request.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.650
No, the way you said it really 
sounded like my little brother.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:24.210
Your little brother... The one in this photo?

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:28.880
Yes. I thought he was back for a second

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.470
after hearing you say that.

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:32.470
"He was back"?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.600
Where is he now?

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.370
He passed away after 
an illness five years ago.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.100
He was about your age at the time.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.220
I never knew something like 
that happened to you, Reone!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.360
